        yLabel="gain"
        zeroLine
        caption={`${W} s looks pass little above 0.3 Hz, but a tracked point does not follow the boxcar exactly: at 0.5 Hz it keeps ${pct(Math.abs(lp.find((r) => r.f_hz === 0.5)!.recovered_gain))} where the boxcar keeps ${pct(Math.abs(lp.find((r) => r.f_hz === 0.5)!.sinc_gain))}. The first investigation’s R7 injected at 1, 2 and 3 Hz, where a bright point comes back at ${lp.filter((r) => r.f_hz >= 1).map((r) => pct(Math.abs(r.recovered_gain))).join(', ')}.`}
      />
      <div class="note-card">
        <span class="tag simulated">simulated and real · P2-03</span>
